      "statement": "ingress-nginx 1.12.0 removes the global-rate-limit feature. This removes the ConfigMap options global-rate-limit-memcached-host, -port, -connect-timeout, -max-idle-timeout, -pool-size and global-rate-limit-status-code, and the annotations global-rate-limit, global-rate-limit-window, global-rate-limit-key and global-rate-limit-ignored-cidrs, so these settings are no longer honoured."
